<Behavior #cell-runtime-composer-and-mod-profiles apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #runtime-assembly-lifecycle-hooks (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D0W>
      系统 SHALL 让现有 module extension/manifest 支持 first-class lifecycle hook 字段，并将 hook definitions 作为 runtime assembly result 的正式组成部分暴露；assembly 层 SHALL NOT 拥有 hook dispatcher。
      </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D0W>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #hook-assembly { name = "Lifecycle hook assembly" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #extension-contributes-hooks [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D0X>
              assembly state SHALL 从该 extension 或 module manifest 的 `hooks` 字段收集 hook descriptors
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D0X>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D0Y>
              assembly result SHALL 暴露最终 lifecycle hook descriptors
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D0Y>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D0Z>
              某个 runtime extension 需要贡献 lifecycle hook
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D0Z>
              <When ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D10>
              composer 组装 runtime profile
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D10>
            )>
            <Case #assembly-does-not-own-dispatcher [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D11>
              assembly result SHALL 暴露 hook descriptors 而不是 lifecycle hook dispatcher
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D11>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D12>
              `ai-organ-logic` SHALL own lifecycle hook producer and dispatcher runtime behavior
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D12>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D13>
              runtime profile 包含 AI kernel baseline
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D13>
              <When ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D14>
              composer 完成 runtime assembly
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D14>
            )>
            <Case #overlay-order-is-preserved [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D15>
              最终 hook list SHALL 保留可确定的 extension 贡献顺序
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D15>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D16>
              `ai-organ-logic` dispatcher SHALL 再按 hook point、phase、priority、extension id、name 形成执行顺序
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D16>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D17>
              多个 profile overlay 都贡献 lifecycle hook
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D17>
              <When ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D18>
              composer 按 profile 叠加顺序 reduce extensions
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D18>
            )>
            <Case #no-parallel-hook-registry [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D19>
              它们 SHALL 通过现有 module extension/manifest 的 `hooks` 字段声明 hook
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D19>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D1A>
              系统 SHALL NOT 要求它们调用另一条 hook 注册 API
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D1A>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D1B>
              mod-ai-kernel、mod-ai-coding 或第三方 mod 需要声明 hook
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D1B>
              <When ?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D1C>
              它们参与 runtime profile assembly
              </?01M05F1P1WD8DCP2ED6F8X1D1C>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
